#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Service Manager</guilabel> module allows you to have an "
"overview of all plugins of the &kde; Daemon, also referred to as &kde; "
"Services. Generally, there are two types of service:"
msgstr ""
"Modul <guilabel>Upravitelj usluge</guilabel> omogućava Vam da imate uvid na "
"sve priključke &kde; Deamon-a, također se misli na &kde; usluge. Generalno, "
"postoje dva tima usluga:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load-on-Demand Services"
msgstr "Servisi učitavani na zahtjev"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of available &kde; services which will be started on demand. "
"They are only listed for convenience, as you cannot manipulate these "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je lista dostupnih &kde; usluga koje će biti pokrenute na zapovijed. Oni "
"su prikazani samo radi pregleda, s obzirom da njima nije moguće manipulisati."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Startup Services"
msgstr "Servisi pri pokretanju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This shows all &kde; services that can be loaded on &kde; startup. Services "
"checked in the <guilabel>Use</guilabel> column will be invoked on next "
"startup."
msgstr ""
"Ovo prikazuje sve &kde; servise koji mogu biti učitani pri &kde; pokretanju. "
"Usluge označene u koloni  <guilabel>Koristi</guilabel> će biti pozvani pri "
"sljedećem pokretanju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be careful with deactivation of unknown services: some services are vital "
"for &kde;; do not deactivate services if you do not know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"Budite oprezni pri deaktivaciji nepoznatih usluga: neke usluge su vitalne za "
"&kde;; ne deaktivirajte usluge ako ne znate šta radite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the <guilabel>Status</guilabel> of a service, select it in the "
"list. Then you can use the <guibutton>Start</guibutton> and <guibutton>Stop</"
"guibutton> to change the status of a service from <guilabel>Not running</"
"guilabel> to <guilabel>Running</guilabel> and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Da biste promijenili <guilabel>Status</guilabel> usluge, označite je u "
"listi. Onda možete koristiti <guibutton>Pokreni</guibutton> i "
"<guibutton>Zaustavi</guibutton> da promijenite status iz "
"<guilabel>Zaustavljen</guilabel>  u <guilabel>Pokrenut</guilabel> i obrnuto."
